WEBVTT

01:33.080 --> 01:34.080
"Pure and innocent"!

01:35.240 --> 01:36.680
Sister, what does that mean?

01:37.759 --> 01:38.520
Nothing.

01:39.600 --> 01:40.920
[Why did he put up]

01:40.920 --> 01:42.200
[the paperweight I gave him as a prize?]

01:43.840 --> 01:44.440
[Not good.]

01:44.840 --> 01:45.880
[He thinks the prize I offered]

01:45.880 --> 01:46.680
[was far too valuable.]

01:46.920 --> 01:48.120
[He's hinting at me.]

01:49.039 --> 01:49.759
[True.]

01:50.160 --> 01:51.360
[There are too many people here today.]

01:51.720 --> 01:53.080
[So many eyes are watching.]

01:53.759 --> 01:54.400
[No.]

01:54.840 --> 01:55.840
[No matter what,]

01:55.840 --> 01:56.960
[I must win that paperweight back.]

01:57.320 --> 01:58.400
[Then no one will think]

01:58.400 --> 02:00.120
[I was deliberately giving the Chen family a gift.]

02:00.600 --> 02:01.800
[If I clear my name,]

02:02.160 --> 02:03.800
[his name will be cleared too.]

02:04.200 --> 02:05.520
This is a fine piece.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.000
This jade paperweight

02:07.240 --> 02:08.560
looks very valuable.

02:08.759 --> 02:10.800
The Chen family truly is wealthy.

02:11.640 --> 02:12.800
Wealthy?

02:13.360 --> 02:14.800
Squeezed from the people.

02:20.560 --> 02:22.120
Two realms split by one beam.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.640
The greater bows to the small.

02:23.760 --> 02:24.880
Five warriors above,

02:24.880 --> 02:26.320
can't beat a pair below.

02:26.520 --> 02:27.240
Guess the object.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.800
What large and small kingdoms?

02:32.079 --> 02:32.800
This object of yours

02:33.120 --> 02:34.280
must be a spirit-writing stick

02:34.280 --> 02:35.160
and a Daoist sand tray.

02:35.600 --> 02:36.160
Wrong.

02:36.480 --> 02:37.120
How is that wrong?

02:37.560 --> 02:38.160
Didn't you ask me

02:38.160 --> 02:39.200
to find a Daoist for you?

02:40.079 --> 02:41.440
Anyway, your answer is wrong.

02:43.600 --> 02:44.680
Stop being so cryptic.

02:48.800 --> 02:51.200
Only green willows may tether a horse.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.040
Only

02:53.240 --> 02:54.200
green... horse...

03:00.600 --> 03:02.200
Sunlight over a gushing spring.

03:04.400 --> 03:05.680
Brother Ye,

03:06.480 --> 03:07.800
the place in your riddle

03:07.960 --> 03:09.680
isn't somewhere you've been, is it?

03:10.520 --> 03:11.320
Of course it is.

03:11.600 --> 03:12.480
But Brother Ye,

03:12.480 --> 03:14.200
you've traveled far and wide.

03:14.520 --> 03:15.520
The places you've been

03:15.640 --> 03:16.760
are places others have never seen.

03:17.120 --> 03:18.240
Isn't it unfair

03:18.240 --> 03:19.680
to set such a riddle?

03:20.760 --> 03:21.960
Then I'll withdraw the riddle

03:22.320 --> 03:23.040
and stop playing.

03:23.160 --> 03:23.640
No, don't.

03:24.040 --> 03:25.560
What if someone guesses it?

03:25.920 --> 03:26.840
I know the answer.

03:27.760 --> 03:29.280
Sunlight over a gushing spring.

03:30.079 --> 03:31.040
Is it Yangquan?

03:32.000 --> 03:32.640
Correct.

03:34.360 --> 03:35.040
Here.

03:35.480 --> 03:36.320
I'll have someone

03:36.320 --> 03:37.079
send you gunpowder.

03:38.200 --> 03:39.040
Thank you, Lord Ye.

03:43.079 --> 03:44.240
How did you guess it?

03:44.440 --> 03:46.840
My ancestral home is in Shanxi.

03:47.280 --> 03:48.600
This guessing game isn't fun at all.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.680
Such a dawdler.

03:57.880 --> 04:00.080
Green willow means the wood radical.

04:01.000 --> 04:02.040
Tethering a horse

04:02.360 --> 04:03.920
must be the other half.

04:05.080 --> 04:06.160
Is it qiang, meaning mast?

04:06.960 --> 04:07.680
Wrong.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.360
Aunt, try again.

04:13.000 --> 04:14.000
It's chu, meaning pestle.

04:14.600 --> 04:16.000
Green willow means the wood radical.

04:16.399 --> 04:17.040
Can tether a horse—

04:17.079 --> 04:18.640
Among the earthly branches,

04:18.959 --> 04:19.839
Horse corresponds to wu.

04:20.040 --> 04:21.160
So the character is chu.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.280
Miss Gu is correct.

04:26.080 --> 04:27.040
How impressive.

04:34.320 --> 04:35.360
Miss Gu is amazing.

04:43.840 --> 04:45.200
Large kingdom, small kingdom...

04:46.280 --> 04:47.159
I know the answer.

04:51.280 --> 04:52.360
Wrong guess.

04:58.400 --> 04:59.760
Still haven't guessed it.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.960
Isn't that Young Master Wang?

05:04.320 --> 05:05.360
Let's go take a look.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.120
Cousin.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.320
What are you doing here?

05:20.280 --> 05:21.920
I just came out of the privy

05:21.920 --> 05:22.840
and lost my way.

05:23.080 --> 05:24.520
I wandered into a room

05:24.800 --> 05:26.480
and happened to see this painting on the desk.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.440
It suits my taste perfectly.

05:27.760 --> 05:28.880
May I ask who painted it?

05:29.040 --> 05:29.960
Could I have it?

05:30.200 --> 05:31.800
This painting has lofty spirit.

05:32.280 --> 05:33.800
It looks like Xuruo's work.

05:35.400 --> 05:36.720
I don't think so.

05:37.120 --> 05:37.800
Why?

05:39.320 --> 05:40.560
Look at the inscription.

05:41.200 --> 05:42.440
"How small the other peaks appear!"

05:43.120 --> 05:44.680
It's Taige style, a formal court script.

05:45.080 --> 05:47.040
Precise, powerful, and dignified.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.240
Without more than ten years of practice,

05:49.400 --> 05:50.840
one couldn't write characters like this.

05:51.240 --> 05:53.040
But Young Master Chen

05:53.720 --> 05:54.800
is so young.

05:55.159 --> 05:56.400
How could he have written it?

05:57.960 --> 05:59.159
Miss Gu is right.

05:59.600 --> 06:01.120
It was indeed not painted by me.

06:03.400 --> 06:05.280
Then what do you think of it?

06:05.600 --> 06:06.560
I think

06:06.720 --> 06:08.560
this painting is not only grand,

06:08.880 --> 06:10.120
but also carries

06:10.800 --> 06:12.040
the force of reaching the summit

06:12.240 --> 06:14.280
and seeing all other peaks below.

06:16.800 --> 06:18.320
It's just...

06:18.920 --> 06:19.680
Only what?

06:20.000 --> 06:21.200
It feels somewhat hollow,

06:21.560 --> 06:23.200
not like true feeling.

06:25.480 --> 06:26.280
Well said.

06:29.480 --> 06:30.240
Brother.

06:33.040 --> 06:33.800
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

06:33.800 --> 06:34.440
Uncle.

06:35.000 --> 06:35.800
Lord Ye.

06:38.720 --> 06:39.600
Young Master Wang.

06:43.960 --> 06:45.000
Then tell me,

06:46.159 --> 06:47.400
who painted

06:47.640 --> 06:49.000
this Ascending the Heights?

06:51.640 --> 06:54.360
It should be an older

06:54.800 --> 06:56.760
and highly respected teacher.

06:57.000 --> 06:58.320
Older?

06:58.560 --> 06:59.520
Highly respected?

07:02.040 --> 07:03.000
Uncle.

07:03.320 --> 07:04.720
Miss Gu did not mean it.

07:07.760 --> 07:08.520
This painting

07:08.840 --> 07:10.200
was done by you?

07:10.520 --> 07:11.200
My apologies.

07:11.480 --> 07:12.920
I spoke out of turn.

07:13.240 --> 07:13.960
I dared to

07:13.960 --> 07:15.400
judge your fine work so rashly.

07:15.640 --> 07:16.720
Please forgive me.

07:18.120 --> 07:18.800
I say,

07:19.640 --> 07:20.880
since you are here as a guest,

07:21.480 --> 07:22.440
why be so afraid?

07:23.640 --> 07:24.360
It's all right.

07:24.920 --> 07:26.120
Once a painting is completed,

07:26.600 --> 07:28.000
it is meant to be judged.

07:28.480 --> 07:30.360
Miss Gu need not apologize.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.440
Exactly.

07:32.040 --> 07:34.000
They say a minister's heart can hold a boat.

07:34.440 --> 07:36.840
Lord Chen is not yet a prime minister,

07:37.040 --> 07:38.360
but he's nearly in the Secretariat.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.960
So, half a boat at least.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.560
But for a dignified prime minister

07:42.560 --> 07:44.159
to hide behind a door and eavesdrop—

07:44.440 --> 07:45.560
that lacks grace.

07:46.880 --> 07:48.560
Someone wanted to critique my painting.

07:48.960 --> 07:50.000
It is only natural

07:50.320 --> 07:51.720
that I wished to hear it.

07:52.000 --> 07:53.320
So it was Lord Chen's painting.

07:53.800 --> 07:55.080
Then may I have it?

07:55.360 --> 07:56.600
Since Young Master Wang likes it,

07:57.000 --> 07:58.000
take it.

07:58.680 --> 08:00.600
Thank you, Lord Chen.

08:03.840 --> 08:05.760
Actually, I came to find Lord Ye.

08:06.440 --> 08:08.160
Lord Ye is of noble character,

08:08.480 --> 08:11.000
and serves as the Crown Prince's reader.

08:11.600 --> 08:12.600
It is getting late.

08:13.320 --> 08:14.160
I fear

08:15.040 --> 08:16.040
he should return.

08:18.800 --> 08:20.200
I still have a riddle unsolved.

08:20.520 --> 08:21.240
I'm not going back.

08:22.840 --> 08:24.320
What kind of riddle

08:24.600 --> 08:25.720
could stump Lord Ye?

08:31.080 --> 08:31.880
Uncle.

08:32.520 --> 08:34.240
It is a riddle from Miss Gu.

08:34.520 --> 08:35.960
It has stumped everyone.

08:36.559 --> 08:37.799
Let's hear it, then.

08:38.799 --> 08:40.360
Two realms split by one beam.

08:40.640 --> 08:42.120
The greater bows to the small.

08:42.520 --> 08:44.080
Five warriors above,

08:44.440 --> 08:45.960
can't beat a pair below.

08:46.320 --> 08:47.040
Guess the object.

08:47.800 --> 08:48.760
Isn't that an abacus?

08:50.000 --> 08:51.280
You actually guessed it.

08:52.080 --> 08:54.040
I'll have the prize sent

08:54.160 --> 08:55.080
to you at once.

08:55.680 --> 08:56.800
You call that hard?

08:57.760 --> 08:58.320
What?

08:59.240 --> 08:59.960
With so many of you here,

08:59.960 --> 09:00.840
no one guessed it?

09:14.640 --> 09:15.320
You all...

09:46.400 --> 09:47.360
Uncle.

09:50.160 --> 09:51.880
Earlier I went to visit Fourth Uncle.

09:52.080 --> 09:53.360
He refused to see me.

09:53.800 --> 09:55.240
Later, Grandmother came as well.

09:55.240 --> 09:56.440
Fourth Uncle still would not see her.

09:56.760 --> 09:57.960
Only after Grandmother said

09:57.960 --> 09:59.080
she would summon a physician

09:59.200 --> 10:00.400
did he open the gate.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.560
Let's not speak of him.

10:04.640 --> 10:05.760
For next spring's imperial exam,

10:06.040 --> 10:07.200
do you plan to sit for it?

10:08.280 --> 10:09.360
That is my intention.

10:09.720 --> 10:11.120
I plan to return to the academy tomorrow

10:11.640 --> 10:12.640
and shut myself in to study.

10:13.640 --> 10:14.160
Good.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.840
Tomorrow, take your essays

10:18.000 --> 10:20.360
to Minister Chang Tinglan's residence

10:20.560 --> 10:21.320
and ask him for guidance.

10:21.520 --> 10:22.680
I have already spoken with him.

10:23.160 --> 10:23.760
From now on,

10:24.000 --> 10:25.040
every ten days,

10:25.560 --> 10:27.120
he will review an essay for you.

10:27.960 --> 10:28.920
Lord Chang?

10:31.000 --> 10:32.520
But he is not a great scholar.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.000
Yes, Third Uncle.

10:40.400 --> 10:41.000
Go.

10:55.920 --> 10:57.000
I think

10:57.280 --> 10:59.280
this painting is not only grand,

10:59.720 --> 11:01.040
but also carries

11:01.680 --> 11:02.960
the force of reaching the summit

11:03.560 --> 11:05.840
and seeing all other peaks below.

11:08.520 --> 11:10.080
It's just...

11:11.680 --> 11:12.840
It feels somewhat hollow,

11:13.240 --> 11:14.920
not like true feeling.

11:54.080 --> 11:55.160
True feeling.

12:17.200 --> 12:17.760
Miss,

12:18.320 --> 12:20.440
incense burns so strongly at Baoxiang Temple.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.600
Yes. Today is the Double Ninth Festival.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.080
Not everyone is here to pray.

12:24.200 --> 12:26.040
Some may be here to climb heights.

12:26.480 --> 12:27.720
Let's hurry forward.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.880
After praying for Grandmother,

12:29.880 --> 12:31.000
we can come back and look around.

12:31.520 --> 12:31.960
Yes, miss.

12:32.920 --> 12:33.600
Look.

12:55.080 --> 12:57.560
Autumn shadows fill the river; wild geese take wing.

12:58.640 --> 13:01.520
With wine and friends, I climb the emerald height.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.160
What a pity.

13:04.320 --> 13:05.680
I didn't bring good wine.

13:06.120 --> 13:07.440
A rare day off

13:07.680 --> 13:09.160
should be spent resting properly.

13:09.600 --> 13:11.000
Why insist on climbing a mountain?

13:17.320 --> 13:18.600
Uncle, you can't run.

13:18.920 --> 13:20.080
I secretly brought you here to climb.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.200
If anything happens to you,

13:21.320 --> 13:22.680
my mother will skin me alive.

13:26.040 --> 13:26.640
Uncle.

13:27.040 --> 13:27.560
Uncle.

13:28.080 --> 13:28.480
Uncle.

13:28.560 --> 13:28.880
My lord.

13:29.160 --> 13:30.200
Uncle, don't scare me.

13:31.120 --> 13:31.600
Uncle.

13:31.600 --> 13:32.000
My lord.

13:34.240 --> 13:35.000
Bodhisattva above,

13:35.520 --> 13:36.600
please protect Grandmother.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.080
May she be safe

13:38.560 --> 13:39.400
and free from disaster.

13:58.160 --> 13:58.680
Miss.

14:00.280 --> 14:01.480
Isn't that Lord Ye?

14:02.040 --> 14:02.760
Go see.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.200
Cousin Jinzhao.

14:05.520 --> 14:06.600
What happened to Lord Ye?

14:06.880 --> 14:08.040
His heart may be acting up.

14:09.960 --> 14:11.200
If you know it is his heart ailment,

14:11.480 --> 14:12.400
do you have medicine with you?

14:12.520 --> 14:13.960
He usually keeps medicine on him.

14:14.320 --> 14:15.600
But he happened to be off duty today,

14:15.600 --> 14:16.600
so he didn't bring any.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.040
Guard Li went down

14:18.040 --> 14:18.760
to call a physician.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.320
I understand.

14:20.640 --> 14:22.200
A heart ailment cannot wait.

14:29.720 --> 14:30.400
No.

14:30.560 --> 14:31.440
We can't wait for Guard Li.

14:32.320 --> 14:32.800
Qingpu.

14:33.240 --> 14:34.480
Press his Tanzhong pressure point.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.360
Yes.

14:35.800 --> 14:36.520
Please move aside.

14:38.360 --> 14:39.400
Will this work?

14:49.000 --> 14:49.760
What are you doing?

14:50.200 --> 14:51.000
If you harm him,

14:51.000 --> 14:52.080
our whole family could die.

14:52.240 --> 14:53.400
But we can't just watch him die.

14:53.600 --> 14:54.200
Let go. But...

14:54.600 --> 14:55.560
No buts.

15:06.840 --> 15:07.520
He moved.

15:11.400 --> 15:12.760
Miss, it's working.

15:13.240 --> 15:13.960
It really is.

15:28.160 --> 15:28.960
It's you.

15:30.320 --> 15:31.120
You're awake.

15:32.600 --> 15:33.360
Thank heaven.

15:33.720 --> 15:34.360
Don't move.

15:34.560 --> 15:35.320
Bodhisattva bless us.

15:35.560 --> 15:36.320
Do you still

15:36.320 --> 15:37.560
feel unwell anywhere?

15:39.960 --> 15:40.520
Yes.

15:40.840 --> 15:41.520
Where?

15:42.320 --> 15:43.040
My hand.

15:44.040 --> 15:45.080
My hand is trapped.

16:10.160 --> 16:11.680
On the road, go slower if you must,

16:11.800 --> 16:12.680
but don't jostle him.

16:13.240 --> 16:13.720
Yes.

16:15.040 --> 16:15.800
And you too.

16:16.120 --> 16:16.920
Don't move around.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.320
Even after taking medicine,

16:18.480 --> 16:20.000
you should rest for several days.

16:21.520 --> 16:23.480
Why such a nag at your age?

16:23.800 --> 16:24.600
What did you say?

16:26.480 --> 16:27.120
I said,

16:27.560 --> 16:29.440
you're so young, yet such a nag,

16:30.320 --> 16:31.440
like an old nanny.

16:44.440 --> 16:45.120
Lift the sedan.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.480
Let's go too.

16:56.000 --> 16:57.920
The Marquis of Changxing leads the military lords.

16:58.400 --> 17:00.760
Ye Xian is his heir.

17:01.400 --> 17:03.240
With a heart ailment, he cannot take up arms.

17:04.119 --> 17:05.440
And he is the marquisate's only son.

17:06.240 --> 17:08.119
If the military heir cannot fight,

17:08.280 --> 17:09.440
he has no future.

17:10.599 --> 17:11.280
Yes.

17:11.839 --> 17:13.520
A heart ailment is hard to cure.

17:23.000 --> 17:23.520
Miss,

17:23.640 --> 17:24.599
you are amazing.

17:30.040 --> 17:30.960
It is getting late.

17:31.160 --> 17:32.040
We've been out for half a day.

17:32.280 --> 17:33.120
We should go back.

17:33.840 --> 17:34.320
Let's go.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.760
When can we pass?

17:46.160 --> 17:47.080
I still have things to do.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.320
I need to go home.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.520
Miss, I'll ask.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.920
When will they let us through?

17:54.920 --> 17:56.200
Can't someone give us an answer?

17:56.200 --> 17:57.440
Say something.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.240
When can we pass?

18:08.160 --> 18:09.600
Miss, I heard

18:09.600 --> 18:11.280
a noble has come to Baoxiang Temple to offer incense.

18:11.440 --> 18:12.760
The whole mountain is sealed off.

18:13.600 --> 18:14.400
Offer incense?

18:14.800 --> 18:15.960
That's clearly a lie.

18:16.280 --> 18:17.960
People offer incense early, not late.

18:18.160 --> 18:19.120
It is already afternoon.

18:19.480 --> 18:20.560
Who comes to offer incense now?

18:21.640 --> 18:22.600
What rotten luck.

18:23.280 --> 18:23.840
Had I known,

18:23.840 --> 18:25.200
I would have gone down with Ye Xian.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.520
When I climbed the tree earlier,

18:29.560 --> 18:30.840
I saw on that hill

18:30.960 --> 18:31.760
another path.

18:32.080 --> 18:33.280
Why don't I go scout it first?

18:33.440 --> 18:34.200
If it can be used,

18:34.280 --> 18:35.040
I'll come back for you.

18:35.480 --> 18:35.960
All right.

18:36.200 --> 18:36.960
Then wait for me.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.960
Let us through.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.520
We need to go down.

18:52.800 --> 18:53.680
Exactly.

18:53.680 --> 18:55.120
We need to go down.

19:01.480 --> 19:02.920
Why isn't Qingpu back yet?

19:04.760 --> 19:06.000
Could something have happened?

19:18.320 --> 19:19.960
Is this the path Qingpu mentioned?

19:21.000 --> 19:22.480
Why is there no one here?

19:34.800 --> 19:35.920
Why isn't there a soul here?

19:57.160 --> 19:57.920
Help!

19:59.360 --> 20:00.360
Mr. Chen!

20:16.880 --> 20:18.080
Protect the Crown Prince.

20:18.440 --> 20:19.080
Yes.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.600
So the man that day

21:42.960 --> 21:44.000
really was him.

21:45.600 --> 21:46.280
Damned Crown Prince.

21:46.360 --> 21:47.560
Die!

22:23.680 --> 22:24.640
Can you still stand?

22:56.080 --> 22:56.760
Were you frightened?

23:06.440 --> 23:07.160
What?

23:07.640 --> 23:08.240
You mean

23:08.400 --> 23:09.760
Jinzhao is still on the mountain?

23:10.160 --> 23:10.800
Yes.

23:11.360 --> 23:12.680
I found a path in the back hills

23:12.960 --> 23:14.040
and planned to return for Miss.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.920
But who would have thought the way back

23:15.920 --> 23:16.960
was also sealed off?

23:17.440 --> 23:18.360
So I came back first

23:18.360 --> 23:19.360
and inform you all.

23:19.880 --> 23:21.240
It will soon be dark.

23:21.240 --> 23:22.720
Please give me more people, Madam,

23:22.720 --> 23:24.120
to go back up the mountain and find Miss.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.120
Good child.

23:25.560 --> 23:26.760
You may have as many as you need.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.240
Take my tally at once

23:28.240 --> 23:29.080
and summon people.

23:29.240 --> 23:30.000
Come, Nanny Zhao.

23:32.760 --> 23:33.480
Thank you, Madam.

23:34.160 --> 23:34.680
Go.

23:38.120 --> 23:38.960
In my view,

23:39.280 --> 23:39.920
Jinzhao

23:40.320 --> 23:41.480
is just too playful.

23:44.040 --> 23:45.280
Jinzhao is not that kind of person.

23:47.760 --> 23:48.640
What are we to do?

23:54.960 --> 23:55.920
Will you confess or not?

23:58.760 --> 23:59.760
Still refusing?

24:11.880 --> 24:12.680
I've already seen him

24:12.680 --> 24:13.840
kill people twice.

24:14.320 --> 24:15.760
Will he kill me to silence me?

24:27.200 --> 24:28.200
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

24:33.600 --> 24:34.240
Mr. Chen.

24:34.440 --> 24:35.720
I truly heard nothing.

24:35.840 --> 24:36.880
I saw nothing.

24:37.000 --> 24:37.440
I promise.

24:37.440 --> 24:38.600
I won't say a single word.

24:39.040 --> 24:39.640
Please.

24:40.040 --> 24:41.760
Please spare my life.

24:47.120 --> 24:48.520
Today's matter is gravely serious.

24:48.800 --> 24:49.760
If word gets out,

24:50.040 --> 24:51.280
who knows how many people

24:51.520 --> 24:53.040
it could bring death upon them.

25:02.800 --> 25:03.840
This is...

25:06.880 --> 25:07.720
Take it.

25:08.920 --> 25:09.960
I cannot protect you otherwise.

25:12.000 --> 25:13.160
It's poison.

25:13.920 --> 25:14.640
Mr. Chen.

25:15.040 --> 25:15.760
I won't breathe

25:15.760 --> 25:16.800
a single word of it.

25:17.200 --> 25:17.760
Otherwise,

25:18.120 --> 25:19.000
may lightning strike me.

25:22.240 --> 25:23.440
No need for oaths.

25:23.640 --> 25:24.720
Take the medicine.

25:25.280 --> 25:26.520
Then I will believe you.

25:27.080 --> 25:27.960
Mr. Chen.

25:28.560 --> 25:29.640
When I came today,

25:29.800 --> 25:31.240
many people saw me.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.600
My maid and I

25:32.880 --> 25:34.080
were together at first,

25:34.680 --> 25:36.040
but then we got separated.

25:36.200 --> 25:36.880
I imagine by now

25:36.880 --> 25:38.080
she has already gone back.

25:38.360 --> 25:39.000
If she finds

25:39.000 --> 25:39.960
she cannot find me,

25:40.200 --> 25:41.600
she will surely send word when she returns.

25:42.120 --> 25:44.000
She may even report it to officials.

25:44.800 --> 25:45.400
Right.

25:45.920 --> 25:46.800
On the way,

25:47.160 --> 25:48.640
Lord Ye saw me too.

25:48.880 --> 25:50.440
If he suddenly learns I died,

25:50.560 --> 25:51.960
he will certainly ask about it.

25:52.280 --> 25:53.280
So what?

25:53.680 --> 25:54.720
If too many people ask,

25:54.880 --> 25:56.160
then everyone will know.

25:57.600 --> 25:58.400
So killing me

25:58.600 --> 25:59.800
would do more harm than good.

26:00.280 --> 26:02.200
And this is sacred Buddhist ground.

26:02.400 --> 26:03.320
Killing here is unlucky.

26:03.640 --> 26:04.400
Please, Mr. Chen.

26:04.760 --> 26:06.280
Why not spare my life?

26:07.120 --> 26:08.600
Saving a life earns great merit.

26:08.840 --> 26:10.560
The dead are the only truly reliable ones.

26:11.560 --> 26:12.560
When today's matter is done,

26:13.080 --> 26:14.680
I will naturally protect your grandmother

26:14.680 --> 26:15.760
and the Ji family

26:16.280 --> 26:17.480
and keep them safe.

26:45.240 --> 26:45.960
Lord Chen.

26:46.840 --> 26:48.200
Why must you do this?

26:48.720 --> 26:50.400
Since you say the girl is one of us,

26:50.600 --> 26:51.800
she can naturally be trusted.

26:52.680 --> 26:53.600
Trustworthy or not,

26:54.600 --> 26:56.640
I trust only what I test myself.

26:59.680 --> 27:00.600
How did it go on your side?

27:01.520 --> 27:02.440
He confessed.

27:03.840 --> 27:04.760
Let's talk inside.

27:11.880 --> 27:12.720
After all that questioning,

27:13.000 --> 27:14.520
he only said the leader's surname is Xiao.

27:14.920 --> 27:16.120
Every time they met,

27:16.120 --> 27:16.880
he wore a veiled hat,

27:17.200 --> 27:18.000
his face was hidden.

27:19.800 --> 27:21.160
From his bearing,

27:21.160 --> 27:22.080
he seemed like a scholar.

27:22.360 --> 27:23.240
He spent freely.

27:24.720 --> 27:26.680
When one of their men died before,

27:27.720 --> 27:28.440
the compensation money

27:28.440 --> 27:29.760
was a full five hundred taels.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.240
That is why each of them

27:31.240 --> 27:32.920
was willing to die for him.

27:33.680 --> 27:34.720
Surname Xiao?

27:36.880 --> 27:38.400
Could it be Xiao Qishan?

27:39.760 --> 27:40.880
Wasn't he once an adviser

27:40.880 --> 27:42.000
to the late Prince Chengqing?

27:42.760 --> 27:44.080
Back then, Prince Chengqing

27:44.080 --> 27:45.600
obeyed that man in everything.

27:46.080 --> 27:48.320
After Prince Chengqing's rebellion failed,

27:48.760 --> 27:50.200
The Marquis killed the prince,

27:50.480 --> 27:52.400
and that adviser vanished.

27:52.840 --> 27:54.520
This time, the news of the Crown Prince leaving the palace

27:54.760 --> 27:55.240
was leaked by us

27:55.240 --> 27:56.760
to Prince Glorian.

27:58.120 --> 27:59.480
But Prince Glorian actually used

27:59.480 --> 28:01.120
one of Prince Chengqing's former strategists.

28:02.000 --> 28:02.680
That means...

28:02.840 --> 28:04.000
It means Prince Glorian

28:04.560 --> 28:05.920
has always brooded

28:06.320 --> 28:07.720
over Prince Chengqing's death.

28:11.720 --> 28:13.080
It seems Prince Glorian

28:13.360 --> 28:14.760
is plotting something big.

28:15.920 --> 28:16.600
Lord Chen,

28:16.960 --> 28:18.520
you must be extra careful.

28:19.640 --> 28:20.760
Same to you.

28:23.080 --> 28:23.800
Lord Chen.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.680
We are in the same boat now.

28:27.840 --> 28:29.400
Back then, the late Prince Chengqing's rebellion

28:29.760 --> 28:31.960
left the Criminal Justice Office in ruins.

28:32.520 --> 28:33.560
If the Chief Councilor

28:33.720 --> 28:35.400
had not valued us,

28:35.600 --> 28:36.360
how could we have

28:36.360 --> 28:37.640
to handle such an important case?

28:38.480 --> 28:39.280
In the future,

28:39.840 --> 28:41.960
I hope you will support me, Lord Chen.

28:42.320 --> 28:43.920
You and I both serve our teacher.

28:44.360 --> 28:45.240
We should

28:45.640 --> 28:47.000
work as one.

29:03.560 --> 29:04.280
Stop pretending.

29:04.640 --> 29:05.160
Get up.

29:14.680 --> 29:15.800
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

29:16.120 --> 29:17.080
Rise and speak.

29:23.000 --> 29:23.800
It's over now.

29:27.680 --> 29:28.640
When today's matter is done,

29:29.200 --> 29:30.800
I will naturally protect your grandmother

29:30.800 --> 29:31.920
and the Ji family

29:32.320 --> 29:33.600
and keep them safe.

29:45.880 --> 29:47.800
Thank you for saving me just now, Mr. Chen.

29:59.720 --> 30:00.320
What is it?

30:00.560 --> 30:01.320
What are you looking at?

30:03.560 --> 30:04.800
I'm looking at you.

30:05.440 --> 30:06.240
You seem

30:06.240 --> 30:07.520
different from before.

30:09.120 --> 30:11.360
I mean that time I set fire to the storeroom

30:11.600 --> 30:13.280
and snatched your lantern.

30:14.600 --> 30:16.040
Why didn't you say so the last two times?

30:17.920 --> 30:19.520
Because I didn't dare.

30:20.200 --> 30:21.200
This time, I dare.

30:21.720 --> 30:23.400
You just saved my life.

30:26.800 --> 30:28.120
You were too afraid to say it

30:28.120 --> 30:29.240
because you saw me kill?

30:30.360 --> 30:32.160
You only killed when you had no choice.

30:33.120 --> 30:34.200
How am I different?

30:37.280 --> 30:38.360
I can't quite say.

30:41.200 --> 30:42.240
It reminds me

30:42.240 --> 30:44.000
of when I lived in Tongzhou.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.160
There was

30:45.520 --> 30:46.760
a young servant named Gou

30:46.760 --> 30:48.080
who played with me often.

30:48.480 --> 30:50.000
We often played together.

30:50.800 --> 30:52.640
But one year he returned to his hometown.

30:52.800 --> 30:53.720
After he came back,

30:53.840 --> 30:55.200
his whole nature changed.

30:55.480 --> 30:57.560
He became quiet

30:58.200 --> 30:59.240
and stopped playing with me.

30:59.400 --> 31:00.680
He only begged Grandmother

31:00.920 --> 31:02.040
to send him to Suzhou

31:02.240 --> 31:03.440
as an apprentice in a shop.

31:04.960 --> 31:06.480
I only learned later

31:07.600 --> 31:08.920
that during that month,

31:09.080 --> 31:10.280
his father had died.

31:12.120 --> 31:13.800
I shall watch from heaven

31:14.920 --> 31:15.960
whether Great Yan

31:15.960 --> 31:17.760
under your protection, Chen Yanyun,

31:19.680 --> 31:21.160
can prosper without end.

31:38.200 --> 31:40.080
I'm not saying you are like him.

31:40.400 --> 31:41.320
What I mean is—

31:41.480 --> 31:42.680
I understand.

31:48.120 --> 31:48.640
Sit.

31:54.600 --> 31:56.080
My ancestral home is also in Tongzhou.

31:56.440 --> 31:57.440
Even now,

31:57.840 --> 31:59.040
your grandmother still manages it.

32:04.280 --> 32:05.840
I wonder when

32:05.840 --> 32:07.320
I can return to Tongzhou.

32:08.720 --> 32:09.440
What is it?

32:10.160 --> 32:11.200
Do you dislike the capital?

32:12.960 --> 32:14.000
I don't like the capital.

32:14.120 --> 32:15.320
The capital isn't fun at all.

32:15.680 --> 32:16.680
Unlike Tongzhou,

32:18.800 --> 32:19.760
there are docks,

32:20.000 --> 32:20.880
temple fairs,

32:21.320 --> 32:22.360
and book markets.

32:23.320 --> 32:25.120
The capital has those too.

32:25.880 --> 32:26.800
The capital is different.

32:27.040 --> 32:27.960
The capital has too many rules.

32:28.120 --> 32:29.320
Many entertainments are forbidden.

32:30.160 --> 32:30.920
For example,

32:30.920 --> 32:31.920
in Tongzhou,

32:32.320 --> 32:34.040
during New Year, we held temple fairs.

32:34.440 --> 32:35.360
Tongzhou's wealthy merchants

32:35.360 --> 32:36.480
take turns hiring opera troupes

32:36.480 --> 32:37.760
to perform at the fairs.

32:38.240 --> 32:39.960
And I loved iron-flower shows.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.200
So every year, Grandmother

32:41.440 --> 32:41.960
hired performers

32:41.960 --> 32:43.320
hired iron-flower performers to perform.

32:43.480 --> 32:44.560
It was so beautiful.

32:45.720 --> 32:47.400
But the capital forbids it.

32:47.720 --> 32:48.920
Forget iron-flower shows.

32:49.160 --> 32:50.920
I heard that since the year before last,

32:51.480 --> 32:53.040
even Aoshan lantern displays are banned.

32:56.280 --> 32:57.240
Molten-iron fireworks?

33:00.760 --> 33:01.480
But

33:02.000 --> 33:04.080
Fire and fireworks can easily start a blaze.

33:10.520 --> 33:11.320
Miss.

33:12.040 --> 33:14.160
Miss, miss.

33:14.520 --> 33:16.000
You finally came down.

33:16.080 --> 33:17.920
I was worried to death.

33:19.120 --> 33:20.040
Are you all right?

33:20.600 --> 33:22.000
Look, I'm fine.

33:22.200 --> 33:22.920
Thank you.

33:23.240 --> 33:24.240
Let's go home. Come.

33:39.160 --> 33:40.520
Did you bump or hurt yourself?

33:41.160 --> 33:42.800
I heard you encountered a noble.

33:43.280 --> 33:44.560
Did they trouble you?

33:46.480 --> 33:47.360
I'm fine.

33:47.720 --> 33:49.200
I just returned a bit late.

33:49.520 --> 33:50.880
Only after the noble left

33:51.000 --> 33:52.320
was I allowed down the mountain.

33:54.280 --> 33:55.720
Which palace was that noble from

33:55.720 --> 33:56.480
to put on such airs?

33:57.360 --> 33:58.680
I wouldn't know.

33:59.320 --> 34:00.680
As long as they didn't trouble you.

34:01.000 --> 34:02.160
Hurry back and rest.

34:02.280 --> 34:03.320
You've had a long day.

34:13.080 --> 34:14.600
What kind of attitude was that?

34:20.880 --> 34:22.040
What are you thinking about, Miss?

34:23.400 --> 34:25.320
The night before my coming-of-age,

34:25.920 --> 34:27.040
I remember it all.

34:28.120 --> 34:29.080
The person I saw that night

34:29.280 --> 34:30.080
was Mr. Chen.

34:31.760 --> 34:32.560
What should we do?

34:33.000 --> 34:34.840
Will Mr. Chen turn against you?

34:38.080 --> 34:38.960
Speaking of that,

34:39.239 --> 34:40.239
there is something

34:40.760 --> 34:41.679
I need you to do.

34:42.679 --> 34:43.639
Please tell me.

34:44.560 --> 34:45.639
I have an old acquaintance,

34:45.679 --> 34:46.320
surnamed Nie.

34:47.000 --> 34:48.719
His wife and daughter are in the capital.

34:49.040 --> 34:49.960
Help me settle them properly.

34:51.040 --> 34:52.120
I cannot show myself.

34:53.120 --> 34:54.040
When you find her,

34:54.360 --> 34:55.280
don't mention me.

34:58.120 --> 34:59.200
He probably won't.

35:00.160 --> 35:01.640
He ordered me to do something for him.

35:03.560 --> 35:04.160
Right.

35:05.040 --> 35:05.760
Tomorrow morning,

35:06.200 --> 35:07.240
go find Shopkeeper Luo.

35:08.040 --> 35:09.480
Ask him to choose several

35:10.440 --> 35:11.400
marionettes.

35:12.200 --> 35:13.000
I need them.

35:19.720 --> 35:20.920
In this capital review,

35:21.080 --> 35:22.000
we found

35:22.320 --> 35:24.800
officials such as Zheng Tuo,

35:24.800 --> 35:25.800
of the Shanxi Bureau,

35:25.800 --> 35:26.880
were found unfit—

35:26.880 --> 35:28.760
376 in all.

35:29.160 --> 35:30.000
Among them,

35:30.320 --> 35:32.640
37 were dismissed,

35:32.920 --> 35:34.920
42 were demoted,

35:35.720 --> 35:37.560
16 were transferred out,

35:38.000 --> 35:40.160
and 28 were formally reprimanded.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.520
The capital officials

35:45.200 --> 35:49.000
number 1,364 in all.

35:50.240 --> 35:53.080
Yet 376 were found unfit.

35:53.720 --> 35:56.120
Many military nobles did not even attend.

35:57.080 --> 35:57.960
The scene

35:59.160 --> 36:01.240
was truly brutal.

36:01.640 --> 36:02.800
So harsh,

36:03.080 --> 36:04.560
yet Master was rated competent.

36:04.960 --> 36:06.000
This shows how strong

36:06.000 --> 36:06.800
his reputation is.

36:07.080 --> 36:08.000
One can only say

36:08.920 --> 36:10.120
it was luck.

36:12.520 --> 36:14.440
I must also thank Lord Lin

36:15.200 --> 36:17.760
for saying in public he was not close to me.

36:20.000 --> 36:23.040
I called him Teacher for so many years,

36:23.880 --> 36:26.120
and he repaid me with "not close."

36:27.560 --> 36:28.400
Yet in the blink of an eye,

36:28.800 --> 36:30.160
he himself got into trouble.

36:33.040 --> 36:33.760
Indeed.

36:34.120 --> 36:35.880
Heaven sees all.

36:42.040 --> 36:42.960
Master.

36:43.120 --> 36:44.400
I have a favor to ask of you.

36:44.600 --> 36:46.440
If you mean managing the household,

36:46.440 --> 36:47.320
then no.

36:47.640 --> 36:48.760
What happened before

36:48.960 --> 36:50.080
was only a few days ago.

36:50.320 --> 36:50.920
Right now,

36:51.520 --> 36:53.160
returning household authority to you

36:53.480 --> 36:54.560
cannot be justified.

36:54.680 --> 36:56.160
It isn't about household authority.

36:56.760 --> 36:58.360
Lan comes of age next year.

36:59.080 --> 37:00.760
She was raised before your eyes.

37:01.440 --> 37:02.600
Her coming-of-age ceremony

37:02.880 --> 37:04.680
should also be decent, shouldn't it?

37:05.400 --> 37:07.640
This is not the time for that.

37:07.640 --> 37:09.040
In any case, that is next year.

37:09.680 --> 37:10.560
We'll discuss it next year.

37:12.480 --> 37:13.600
I just remembered

37:13.880 --> 37:15.360
there are matters in the front courtyard.

37:16.400 --> 37:17.040
That's all for now.

37:23.560 --> 37:24.200
Miss.

37:24.600 --> 37:25.520
These are

37:25.520 --> 37:26.920
the three marionettes you wanted.

37:28.040 --> 37:29.120
They are quite exquisite.

37:29.280 --> 37:29.760
Yes.

37:29.880 --> 37:30.800
We found

37:30.880 --> 37:32.240
the best craftsmen to make them.

37:33.240 --> 37:34.320
Thank you, Uncle Ping.

37:35.400 --> 37:36.520
Then let's go now.

37:43.040 --> 37:43.800
What happened?

37:44.120 --> 37:44.720
Don't panic.

37:45.680 --> 37:46.240
Miss.

37:46.600 --> 37:48.000
to notify Madam Nie.

37:48.000 --> 37:49.840
to notify Madam Nie.

37:50.480 --> 37:51.960
I had just reached Fentiao Alley

37:51.960 --> 37:53.480
I ran into people snatching things.

37:53.960 --> 37:55.480
I ran into a group looting.

37:55.480 --> 37:56.680
the clansmen of Madam Nie's late husband.

37:56.840 --> 37:58.080
They kept saying

37:58.280 --> 37:59.880
the property belongs to the clan

38:00.200 --> 38:01.200
The property belongs to the clan

38:01.200 --> 38:01.960
and must be taken back.

38:02.200 --> 38:03.280
They also said their second brother

38:03.280 --> 38:04.800
was heir to a hereditary title,

38:05.440 --> 38:06.160
called...

38:06.880 --> 38:07.960
the hereditary rank Yunqiwei.

38:08.280 --> 38:09.800
For speaking wildly before His Majesty,

38:10.000 --> 38:11.000
he was beaten to death.

38:11.520 --> 38:13.240
so they blamed Madam Nie for bringing misfortune.

38:13.720 --> 38:14.760
Nie Fengming.

38:15.360 --> 38:15.960
Miss.

38:16.240 --> 38:18.680
Could Mr. Chen's friend be...

38:19.480 --> 38:20.240
Go on.

38:20.560 --> 38:21.080
Yes.

38:21.720 --> 38:22.720
Though I didn't understand

38:22.720 --> 38:23.720
what they meant,

38:23.880 --> 38:24.600
I knew

38:24.800 --> 38:25.640
Madam Nie

38:25.640 --> 38:26.560
Madam Nie

38:26.880 --> 38:28.280
was the person you wanted found.

38:28.840 --> 38:29.440
So

38:29.440 --> 38:30.360
I placed them

38:30.360 --> 38:31.400
at the silk shop.

38:32.120 --> 38:33.120
If I overstepped,

38:33.320 --> 38:34.440
please punish me.

38:35.800 --> 38:36.920
Punish you for what?

38:37.960 --> 38:39.600
For doing the job too well?

38:41.480 --> 38:42.320
Thank you, Miss.

38:42.800 --> 38:43.360
Let's go.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.160
To the silk shop.

39:02.000 --> 39:04.120
May I ask, are you Miss Gu?

39:04.520 --> 39:05.240
Yes.

39:06.680 --> 39:08.120
Thank you, Miss Gu's servant

39:08.120 --> 39:09.320
for helping me out of trouble.

39:09.760 --> 39:10.520
Please, no need.

39:10.840 --> 39:11.880
Please rise.

39:13.720 --> 39:15.920
Miss Gu and I are strangers.

39:16.200 --> 39:17.200
May I ask

39:17.200 --> 39:19.080
why you sent someone to find me?

39:19.440 --> 39:20.520
Here is the matter.

39:20.960 --> 39:22.160
I have a cousin.

39:22.160 --> 39:23.120
Some years ago in the capital,

39:23.120 --> 39:24.320
while doing business,

39:24.640 --> 39:26.040
he received Lord Nie's help.

39:26.720 --> 39:27.840
This cousin of mine

39:28.080 --> 39:29.640
heard I was coming to the capital,

39:30.000 --> 39:32.000
so he asked me to visit you.

39:32.440 --> 39:33.360
Who would have thought

39:33.480 --> 39:35.480
we'd happen upon a disturbance?

39:35.880 --> 39:36.800
Help?

39:37.360 --> 39:38.040
Yes.

39:38.640 --> 39:39.720
This man

39:40.000 --> 39:41.520
was always eager to do public good

39:41.520 --> 39:42.640
and help others.

39:43.080 --> 39:44.280
But he forgot

39:45.120 --> 39:46.480
those who needed his help most

39:47.320 --> 39:48.800
were his own family.

39:53.920 --> 39:55.320
You must be Xiangyun.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.360
This cousin of mine said

39:59.680 --> 40:01.960
this month is Xiangyun's birthday.

40:02.320 --> 40:03.000
So

40:03.040 --> 40:04.600
he specially asked me to bring gifts.

40:08.400 --> 40:09.920
String puppets.

40:10.000 --> 40:12.080
Are all these for me?

40:12.720 --> 40:14.360
Yes, all for you.

40:14.720 --> 40:15.560
Do you like them?

40:15.720 --> 40:16.560
I do.

40:17.000 --> 40:19.240
Mother, may I take them?

40:22.520 --> 40:23.600
Since they are for you,

40:23.760 --> 40:24.880
take them and play.

40:26.360 --> 40:27.480
Xiangyun, come.

40:27.720 --> 40:28.280
Come with sister.

40:28.280 --> 40:28.720
All right.

40:29.080 --> 40:30.160
Thank you, sister.

40:31.200 --> 40:31.680
Miss,

40:31.840 --> 40:34.000
I'll bring more tea and snacks.

40:35.920 --> 40:36.920
Please sit.

40:38.880 --> 40:39.840
This is wound medicine.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.920
Take it home and apply it to your wounds.

40:43.600 --> 40:44.920
Thank you, Miss Gu.

40:45.720 --> 40:48.120
This time, disaster befell him.

40:48.440 --> 40:49.200
The court

40:49.200 --> 40:50.600
pitied us, orphan and widow,

40:50.600 --> 40:51.760
and spared us punishment.

40:52.360 --> 40:53.760
But those clansmen

40:54.040 --> 40:54.920
have instead set their eyes

40:54.920 --> 40:56.600
on my late husband's possessions.

40:56.960 --> 40:58.800
After all is said and done,

40:59.240 --> 41:00.400
it is my fault.

41:00.840 --> 41:02.080
I was blind.

41:02.680 --> 41:03.560
I married

41:03.560 --> 41:05.840
such a heartless, short-lived wretch.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.080
Mother.

41:08.080 --> 41:09.640
Father was a good man.

41:09.760 --> 41:11.200
He is not a ghost.

41:11.600 --> 41:13.200
Your father left us both behind

41:13.360 --> 41:14.640
and went off to die alone.

41:15.080 --> 41:16.440
Yet you still speak for him.

41:16.760 --> 41:18.400
Father did it for righteousness.

41:18.400 --> 41:19.360
For his righteousness,

41:19.480 --> 41:20.920
he sacrificed both our lives

41:21.280 --> 41:22.920
he sacrificed both our lives

41:23.400 --> 41:24.960
and made us suffer like this.

41:25.520 --> 41:27.320
What kind of righteousness is that?

41:27.800 --> 41:29.160
I don't feel it's suffering.

41:29.400 --> 41:30.840
That day Father said

41:31.040 --> 41:32.240
after he died,

41:32.400 --> 41:34.560
I must still live well.

41:34.960 --> 41:36.200
I promised Father,

41:36.440 --> 41:37.840
so I must do it.

41:38.560 --> 41:39.840
After he died?

41:40.320 --> 41:40.840
What?

41:41.040 --> 41:42.520
Did he tell you before he died?

41:43.800 --> 41:45.040
How is that possible?

41:45.400 --> 41:46.480
It was that day,

41:46.720 --> 41:49.160
the night before Father went to the palace.

41:49.160 --> 41:50.160
Enough. Stop talking.

41:52.240 --> 41:53.840
It is late today.

41:53.960 --> 41:55.040
We should be leaving.

41:55.440 --> 41:57.200
Miss Gu, thank you again

41:57.200 --> 41:58.280
for helping me today.

42:00.760 --> 42:01.320
Wait.

42:09.160 --> 42:10.200
Why did you suddenly think

42:10.280 --> 42:12.120
of asking Miss Gu to visit Madam Nie?

42:13.960 --> 42:15.320
It was just a passing impulse.

42:16.440 --> 42:18.120
We spoke a few words at Baoxiang Temple.

42:18.800 --> 42:19.800
I suddenly felt

42:21.840 --> 42:23.200
she was a good choice.

42:24.800 --> 42:27.720
Miss Gu is indeed clever and bold.

42:29.640 --> 42:30.800
She can hold her own in trouble.

42:33.000 --> 42:33.560
Mr. Chen.

42:34.280 --> 42:35.400
Miss Gu sent word.

42:35.840 --> 42:36.800
She asks when you are free

42:36.960 --> 42:38.200
and wants to meet.

42:53.000 --> 42:54.240
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

42:56.840 --> 42:57.520
Rise.

42:58.760 --> 43:00.160
Why have you come to me?

43:00.200 --> 43:00.800
Speak.

43:04.680 --> 43:06.000
Mr. Jiang is not an outsider.

43:06.840 --> 43:08.280
Say what you need to say.

43:10.920 --> 43:12.320
I came to report back.

43:12.920 --> 43:13.920
The matter you entrusted to me

43:13.920 --> 43:14.960
has been completed.

43:15.840 --> 43:17.440
No wonder you would not appear yourself

43:17.800 --> 43:18.960
and sent me instead.

43:24.360 --> 43:26.280
You met Madam Nie and Xiangyun.

43:26.560 --> 43:27.840
I not only met them,

43:28.120 --> 43:28.840
I also

43:29.000 --> 43:30.720
dealt with a pack of Nie clansmen.

43:32.200 --> 43:33.320
They forced Madam Nie

43:33.600 --> 43:34.440
to hand over

43:34.440 --> 43:35.440
what Lord Nie left behind.

43:35.960 --> 43:37.120
what Lord Nie left behind.

43:37.600 --> 43:38.840
and swallow up the Nie estate.

43:39.280 --> 43:40.200
You have no idea.

43:40.480 --> 43:41.400
You didn't see

43:41.680 --> 43:42.400
how far

43:42.400 --> 43:43.480
they had pushed her.

43:44.600 --> 43:45.400
I don't know

43:46.000 --> 43:47.520
what relationship

43:47.640 --> 43:48.920
you had with Lord Nie.

43:49.640 --> 43:50.760
Nor do I wish to know.

43:51.120 --> 43:51.960
I only hope

43:52.320 --> 43:53.520
that for Xiangyun

43:53.520 --> 43:54.640
and Madam Nie's sake,

43:54.880 --> 43:56.160
you can help them.

43:56.800 --> 43:58.080
so their lives

43:58.680 --> 43:59.640
can be a little easier.

44:01.800 --> 44:02.520
No.

44:02.920 --> 44:03.720
Why?

44:04.320 --> 44:04.920
Can't you

44:04.920 --> 44:06.160
help that orphan and widow?

44:06.280 --> 44:07.200
There is no why.

44:07.400 --> 44:08.480
No means no.

44:08.880 --> 44:10.880
Do not mention this again.

44:11.560 --> 44:12.240
Go back.

44:14.400 --> 44:14.960
Fine.

44:15.480 --> 44:16.520
Since you won't help,

44:16.680 --> 44:17.600
then I'll do it. All right?

44:18.080 --> 44:19.160
What you refuse to do yourself,

44:19.160 --> 44:19.920
I'll stand in.

44:20.240 --> 44:21.680
I promise it won't implicate you.

44:21.880 --> 44:22.880
Will that satisfy you?
